            /// 🐛️ Ticket 26/08/16/HUB-SPACES-LIVE-PRESENCE-AND-COLLABORATIVE-STUDIOS lane 4-G — WITH
            /// TEETH: `ShellHost::encodeWindowActionInvocation` addresses every real click with the
